# ============================================
# ADDED: Sheet backup files
# ============================================
# Backups created during manual/scripted sheet edits. The primary
# workbook (.xlsx) and working CSV are tracked; every backup copy
# is not.
comprehensive_grocery_certifications_COMPLETE.xlsx.*
comprehensive_grocery_certifications_COMPLETE.csv.*
comprehensive_grocery_certifications_COMPLETE.xlsx.backup
comprehensive_grocery_certifications_COMPLETE.csv.backup
*_backup*
*.pre-*

# ============================================
# ADDED: Throwaway analysis scripts
# ============================================
# One-off scripts written during data cleanup / investigation.
# These are not part of the app and should not be committed.
